        {
          "id": "6pyc5kk",
          "type": "say",
          "text": "Sparrow Bay Lane... you've lived here your whole life."
        },
        {
          "id": "8towphd",
          "type": "setBackground",
          "image": "assets/backgrounds/back-lw0mvuf_closeupstreet.png",
          "transition": {
            "type": "dissolve",
            "durationMs": 500
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "lc6ruov",
          "type": "say",
          "text": "School just let out for summer and the neighborhood was already bustling with tourists and beach-goers."
        },
        {
          "id": "cmd-9qovnvn",
          "type": "say",
          "text": "You always made friends easily with the kids who vacationed here."
        },
        {
          "id": "enlrccb",
          "type": "setBackground",
          "image": "assets/backgrounds/back-5ywq260__s-1824911215_upscale.png",
          "transition": {
            "type": "dissolve",
            "durationMs": 1000
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "o7re9ia",
          "type": "say",
          "text": "Every year, you'd meet and make so many friends. But once summer was over... so was that friendship."
        },
        {
          "id": "w9hfc74",
          "type": "setBackground",
          "image": "assets/backgrounds/back-y6dbj96_kai_s_house_-_far_away.png",
          "transition": {
            "type": "dissolve",
            "durationMs": 1000
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "me2nfd3",
          "type": "say",
          "text": "You round the corner to your block and see the usually abandoned beach house at the end of the street is lit up on the inside."
        },
        {
          "id": "v3wyaj6",
          "type": "say",
          "text": "A woman stands outside, looking around frantically. You decide to take a closer look and as you approach, the woman sees you and grins from ear to ear."
        },
        {
          "id": "6itb1kd",
          "type": "jump",
          "scene": "scene-2rrq784"
        }
      ]
    },
